// denext (DENEXT.md item 451): the reviewed list of what fails when the suites
// run under DENO_INTERNAL_KERNEL_SANDBOX_FORCE (README.md). Keys: the forced
// mode, then the suite, then test names (a trailing `*` is a prefix); `os`
// limits an entry to some OSes (`linux`, `darwin`; default: every OS);
// `reason` says why. Nothing here is skipped: the tests run, and compare.ts
// fails a bed on any failure not listed.
